config RZI_POWER
	bool "RZI power helpers"
	help
	  Service PM locks, a runtime switch for native Zephyr PM locks,
	  and thread waits. Class C, storage writes, and FUOTA transfer
	  or apply take and release PM locks. Class A join/send do not,
	  so the backend can STOP between TX and RX1/RX2. Enable CONFIG_PM
	  in the application to use system PM; Zephyr's policy and the SoC
	  device tree select the actual state. Ordinary CPU idle works
	  without PM.
